204	    /**
205	     * The owner's membership level, a number from 1 to 3 fixed at creation. It starts at 1, gains a
206	     * level when an email address is present, and gains a level when the owner has no namesakes
207	     * ({@code namesakeCount} is zero); it is capped at 3. Level 4 is reserved for tenure.
